[% USE raw %]
[% PROCESS 'i18n.inc' %]
[% SET footerjs = 1 %]
[% INCLUDE 'doc-head-open.inc' %]
<title>DataTables for Reports - Configuration</title>
[% INCLUDE 'doc-head-close.inc' %]
</head>
<body id="plugin_datatables_configure" class="plugins">
[% WRAPPER 'header.inc' %]
[% END %]

[% WRAPPER 'sub-header.inc' %]
    [% WRAPPER breadcrumbs %]
        [% WRAPPER breadcrumb_item %]
            <a href="/cgi-bin/koha/plugins/plugins-home.pl">Plugins</a>
        [% END %]
        [% WRAPPER breadcrumb_item bc_active= 1 %]
            DataTables for Reports
        [% END %]
    [% END %]
[% END %]

<div class="main container-fluid">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">

            <h1><i class="fa fa-table"></i> DataTables for Reports</h1>

            <p>This plugin adds an interactive <strong>"Open in DataTables"</strong> button to Koha report results.</p>
            <p>It fetches all report data via the built-in CSV export and replaces the standard paginated table
               with a full-featured DataTables view.</p>

            <h3>How to use</h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Go to <a href="/cgi-bin/koha/reports/guided_reports.pl">Reports</a> and run any saved report.</li>
                <li>Click the green <strong>"Open in DataTables"</strong> button in the toolbar.</li>
                <li>Click <strong>"Back to original view"</strong> to return to the standard Koha table.</li>
            </ol>

            <h3>Features</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Sorting</strong> &mdash; click any column header to sort ascending/descending</li>
                <li><strong>Full-text search</strong> &mdash; filters across all columns in real time</li>
                <li><strong>Page size</strong> &mdash; adjustable (10 / 25 / 50 / 100 / 250 / 500 / All)</li>
                <li><strong>Column visibility</strong> &mdash; show or hide individual columns via the "Columns" button</li>
                <li><strong>Column resize</strong> &mdash; drag the right edge of any header to adjust width</li>
                <li><strong>Fixed header</strong> &mdash; column headers stay visible while scrolling</li>
                <li><strong>Fit To Page + Word Wrap</strong> &mdash; toggle button to constrain the table to the window width and enable word wrap in all cells</li>
                <li><strong>Export</strong> &mdash; export the currently filtered and sorted data as Copy, CSV (semicolon-separated), Excel (XLSX), PDF (landscape) or Print</li>
                <li><strong>Sidebar auto-hide</strong> &mdash; the Koha sidebar is hidden in DataTables view to maximize table space and restored when switching back</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Configuration</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">There are no user-configurable settings at the moment.
               Future versions may add customization options (e.g. default page size, export format preferences).</p>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

[% MACRO jsinclude BLOCK %]
[% END %]

[% INCLUDE 'intranet-bottom.inc' %]
